### ============================================
### 5. Tickets API - 更新
### ============================================

### 更新 Ticket（完整字段）
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的标题",
  "description": "更新后的描述",
  "priority": "low",
  "label_ids": ["{{labelId}}"]
}

### 更新 Ticket（只更新标题）
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "只更新标题"
}

### 更新 Ticket（只更新优先级）
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": "critical"
}

### 更新 Ticket（只更新标签）
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label_ids": ["{{labelId}}"]
}

### 更新 Ticket（移除所有标签）
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label_ids": []
}

