### 6. Tickets API - 状态管理
### ============================================

### 完成 Ticket
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/complete

### 重新打开 Ticket
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/reopen

###
### ============================================
### 7. Tickets API - 删除
### ============================================

### 删除 Ticket
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}

