### ============================================
### 9. 完整工作流测试
### ============================================

### 步骤 1: 创建标签
### ⚠️ 注意：每次测试时修改标签名称，避免 409 冲突
### 建议使用时间戳：工作流测试标签-20241204-001
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "工作流测试标签-20241204-001",
  "color": "#8b5cf6",
  "description": "用于测试完整工作流"
}

### 步骤 2: 获取刚创建的标签（从响应中复制 labelId）
# GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/labels?sort_by=created_at

### 步骤 3: 创建 Ticket 并关联标签（替换 <label-id-from-step-1>）
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "工作流测试 Ticket",
  "description": "这是一个完整工作流测试",
  "priority": "medium",
  "label_ids": ["<label-id-from-step-1>"]
}

### 步骤 4: 获取刚创建的 Ticket（从响应中复制 ticketId）
# GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets?sort_by=created_at

### 步骤 5: 完成 Ticket（替换 <ticket-id-from-step-3>）
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/<ticket-id-from-step-3>/complete

### 步骤 6: 重新打开 Ticket
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/<ticket-id-from-step-3>/reopen

### 步骤 7: 更新 Ticket
# PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/<ticket-id-from-step-3>
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "title": "更新后的工作流测试 Ticket",
#   "priority": "high"
# }

### 步骤 8: 删除 Ticket
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/tickets/<ticket-id-from-step-3>

### 步骤 9: 删除标签
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/labels/<label-id-from-step-1>

